SCOPE: THIS LICENSE COVERS THE CODE ONLY, NOT THE DATA.

The MIT license above applies to the source code in this repository (the
Python pipeline, scripts and workflow). It does not cover, and grants no rights
to, any data the code downloads or publishes, including everything in the
generated feed (index.json, prices*.json, history/, daily/, manifest.json) and
on the `data` branch:

* Prices are TCGplayer market data, obtained through TCGCSV (https://tcgcsv.com).
  They belong to TCGplayer.
* Card data comes from TCGdex (https://tcgdex.dev). Card names, card text, set
  names, artwork and images are (c) Nintendo, Creatures, GAME FREAK and The
  Pokémon Company, or their other respective owners.
* Fallback image URLs point to pokemontcg.io / Scrydex and TCGplayer, and
  species data comes from PokéAPI; those remain their owners' terms.

Pokémon is a trademark of Nintendo, Creatures, GAME FREAK and The Pokémon
Company. Evodex and this repository are unofficial and are not affiliated
with, endorsed, sponsored or approved by any of the companies or projects
named above.
